# The entities outro sting, 9x16: outro.html recorded by reel itself, unframed; finish.sh trims Chromium's window rim
# and writes media/<name>.mp4, the film's OutroBackground.
Open outro.html
Output media/outro-9x16.take.mp4
Set Viewport 540x960
Set Browser chromium
Set Quality 90
Set ClickRipples off
Set Cursor off

# Off camera: the fonts load, then the second Open starts every animation from its first frame.
Hide
Wait css:"main"
Sleep 1s
Open outro.html
Wait css:"main"
Show
Sleep 4s
